   "date": "2017-03-20",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Greens introduced the Fair Work Amendment (Protecting Weekend Pay and Penalty Rates) Bill 2017 to block the Fair Work Commission’s penalty rate cuts for young and low-paid workers, arguing weekend and public holiday rates are essential for living wages. The bill would prevent rates from falling below their start-of-2017 levels, and the Greens challenged Senators Hinch, Xenophon and Hanson to support it."
  }
 ],
